Kirousis & Papadimitriou (1986)'s proof of ns >= vs + 1, proved; proof_reductions.md corrected\n8bf47dec2 paper2/proof_reductions.md: the gap in Kirousis & Papadimitriou (1986)'s proof of ns = vs + 1, and the corrected argument","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
